olor: rgb(24, 24, 24);&quot;&gt;can help! We appreciate your business and look forward to continuing our partnership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24);&quot;&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24);&quot;&gt;The EverQuote Customer Success Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</stringValue>
